ezik propast im donosi, kimaju glavom oni što ih vide:"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["svi se boje, Božje djelo slave i misle o onom što on učini."]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["Pravednik se raduje u Jahvi, njemu se utječe, i kliču svim srcem čestiti."]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/hrv_iva/PSA/64.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/hrv_iva/PSA/65.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/hrv_iva/PSA/63.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}